## Screens & components annotated

| Screen | Route | Components hinted |
|---|---|---|
| Dashboard | `/` | `StatCard` ×4, `RecentTransactions`, `MonthlyChart`, `ExpenseChart` |
| Transactions | `/transactions` | `TransactionFilters`, table, summary, `TransactionDialog`, delete dialog |
| Categories | `/categories` | Income + expense grids, `CategoryCard`, `CategoryDialog`, delete dialog |
| Reports | `/reports` | Month select, summary, daily chart, 2 by-category breakdowns |
